The State of <<South Carolina>> }
County of <<Beaufort>>          }

Personally appeared before me
Rebecca Brown widow of Frederick
Brown who was sergeant of Co "D" 33rd
U. S. C. Infty, and after being duly
sworn deposes and says, that she
cannot produce the pension certificate
of her late husband, the said Fred-
erick Brown, for the reason that the
said certificate has, with other papers
of hers, been destroyed by either rats
or roaches,
Sworn to before me                 }
this 24th day of Feby 1899         }
J. C. Maranborough                 }   Rebecca Brown
  Notary Public                    }
    <<Port Royal>> .S.C.               }
